# CVE-2025-68121 (Go crypto/tls stdlib, postgres:16-alpine moving tag):
# CRITICAL with upstream fixes released (Go 1.24.13) but the alpine
# postgres image has not been rebuilt with them yet (checked 2026-09-09).
# The Go binary involved is build tooling, not the postgres server
# itself; the container is on the internal network with no TLS ingress.
# Revisit: drop when the 16-alpine moving tag carries Go >= 1.24.13.
CVE-2025-68121
